    "The geometric metallic belt buckle interrupts the monochromatic suiting with a harsh structural focal point; this hardware application invokes cybernetic concepts of the plugged-in body; the angular gold and silver facets reflect the surrounding light intensely; the element completes the garment's architecture by serving as a visual linchpin for the severe planar logic of the torso.": "The geometric metallic belt buckle interrupts the monochromatic suiting with a harsh structural focal point; this hardware application invokes cybernetic concepts of the plugged-in body; the angular gold and silver facets reflect the surrounding light intensely; the element completes the garment's architecture by serving as a visual linchpin for the severe planar logic of the torso.",
    "The transparent polyurethane visor creates a distinct barrier between the face and the observer; this protective eyewear engages directly with techno-political paradigms of environmental hostility; the thick translucent arms grip the skull tightly behind the ears; this shielding asserts a necessary defensiveness within the collection's hyper-modern landscape.": "The transparent polyurethane visor creates a distinct barrier between the face and the observer; this protective eyewear engages directly with techno-political paradigms of environmental hostility; the thick translucent arms grip the skull tightly behind the ears; this shielding asserts a necessary defensiveness within the collection's hyper-modern landscape.",
    "High-Gloss Polyurethane Paneling": "High-Gloss Polyurethane Paneling",
