    "The transparent polyurethane visor standardizes the model's gaze beneath a curved synthetic lens; this framing device engages with theories of digital identity by erasing organic facial nuance; the clear material sits starkly against the bare skin; the eyewear asserts a uniform code of anonymity across the collection.": "The transparent polyurethane visor standardizes the model's gaze beneath a curved synthetic lens; this framing device engages with theories of digital identity by erasing organic facial nuance; the clear material sits starkly against the bare skin; the eyewear asserts a uniform code of anonymity across the collection.",
    "Asymmetrical Draped Bodice": "Asymmetrical Draped Bodice",
